{"4125490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Teeth Cutter", "steam_appid": 4125490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4808660], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teeth Cutter is a collection of short horror stories. Each scenario is trying to deliver you something terrifying.  Experience multiple distinct horror scenarios, each lasting from a few minutes to half an hour. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>THE HORROR THAT AWAITS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Intruder</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man comes home from work to find that someone is in his house. What will he do to this heinous intruder?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/bc69db8664f58dfe964ca973f6add96c.poster.avif?t=1782080277\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/bc69db8664f58dfe964ca973f6add96c.webm?t=1782080277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/bc69db8664f58dfe964ca973f6add96c.mp4?t=1782080277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Father Martin Is Missing</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a private investigator looking for a lost father of a newly constructed church. Read his notes and investigate the area to find out what happened to him. Hear the sounds of God's breath. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/5f30d161240fab9f21f108b2e332c29b.poster.avif?t=1782080277\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/5f30d161240fab9f21f108b2e332c29b.webm?t=1782080277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/5f30d161240fab9f21f108b2e332c29b.mp4?t=1782080277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Terminal</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cop uses a new piece of technology to scan a memory of a crime. Figure out what happened in this <i>bizarre</i> murder suicide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/fb81ca0088c2258084d9aa6f7056d528.poster.avif?t=1782080277\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/fb81ca0088c2258084d9aa6f7056d528.webm?t=1782080277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/fb81ca0088c2258084d9aa6f7056d528.mp4?t=1782080277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Normal Fishing</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lake made of blood, fish that whisper, setting fire for an ancient god? All in all just another normal day of fishing on the lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/f7e84ebaebd33fc114fce334137ac501.poster.avif?t=1782080277\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/f7e84ebaebd33fc114fce334137ac501.webm?t=1782080277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125490/extras/f